# With its target gone as it resolves the Rage does nothing (CR 608.2b): Bot2's Lightning Bolt, cast in response, kills the
# Memnite first, so the Rage is countered on resolution and no delayed trigger is set up (the Memnite died before it could
# watch it): Bot1 gets no Detective.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Memnite
Felonious Rage
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Felonious Rage.Cast(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Felonious Rage; Memnite

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 1
